    {
      "bbox": [
        445,
        561,
        1232,
        599
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Changes in the Medicaid program affect a broad range of City services and coordination is required to permit full assessment of the impact of any action; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
