      "text": "All agencies shall cooperate with the Medicaid Coordinator and the Medicaid Task Force, and shall provide such information and data concerning Medicaid operations as may be requested by the Medicaid Coordinator, the Medicaid Task Force or the Executive Director of the Medicaid Task Force. No actions shall be taken by any agency which significantly affect the operations of the Medicaid program, until these actions have been reviewed and approved by the Medicaid Coordinator who shall consult with the Medicaid Task Force. All agencies shall comply with directives of the Medicaid Coordinator with respect to actions required to comply with the New York City Financial Plan as applicable to the Medicaid program.",
